#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:95 aab2db09d0e445418ff82b781572ad09
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:96 d5d1eb0b52f34493817005302830e8c7
msgid ""
"Protocol capability of each motor/servo output including its pin name. Timer"
" groupings with warning about all outputs in a group must be the same "
"protocol. PWM serial LEDs should be designated here."
msgstr "每个电机/舵机输出的协议能力及其引脚名称。定时器分组，并注明同一组内所有输出必须使用相同协议。PWM 串行 LED 也应在此处标注。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:101 69c0bed91b08492d93f4a837fb4a9828
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:102 9f9e983ba5ce49feb26c707bd014e3bc
msgid ""
"This is the most complex section due to the multitude of ways boards have "
"their RC inputs configured in the board design and that F4s vs H7 have "
"different capabilities."
msgstr "由于各板卡在设计上配置 RC 输入的方式多样，且 F4 与 H7 具有不同能力，本节是最复杂的部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:104 c7a61a49c8334ed1947d572d547db6c6
msgid ""
"The important point is that information should be provided as to where to "
"connect each type of receiver and what ArduPilot parameters must be set for "
"each."
msgstr "重点是需要说明每种接收机的连接位置，以及各自需要设置哪些 ArduPilot 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:106 364d843edd794d28adea31a5259da66b
msgid "Also, if a board alternate config can be used, it should be mentioned."
msgstr "此外，如果板卡支持备用配置，也应加以说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:108 d6305bd9148348b0a3eb29a59fa1c4e2
msgid ""
"Broad group names can be used, ie \" Using the RCin pin will support all "
"unidirectional RC protocols.\" Which would cover PPM, SBUS, iBus, PPM-Sum, "
"DSM,DSM2,DSM-X,SRXL, and SUM-D\"."
msgstr ""
"可使用宽泛的分组名称，例如「使用 RCin 引脚将支持所有单向 RC 协议」，涵盖 PPM、SBUS、iBus、PPM-"
"Sum、DSM、DSM2、DSM-X、SRXL 和 SUM-D。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:110 7af34da4b0fc40809b5f484da938a933
msgid ""
"Bi-directional protocols like CRSF/ELRS,SRXL2,IRC Ghost, and FPort need "
"specific instructions with at least CRSF/ELRS instructions and  a link to "
":ref:`common-rc-systems`."
msgstr ""
"双向协议（如 CRSF/ELRS、SRXL2、IRC Ghost 和 FPort）需要具体说明，至少提供 CRSF/ELRS 的操作指南及 "
":ref:`common-rc-systems` 的链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:115 d311157d63c344f595466d14d9da8dd7
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:116 040c48ea59864dc7a0666cc70ea49947
msgid ""
"Note if onboard OSD is provided. hwdef should already set "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>`. Adding :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` 5  in the "
"defaults.param file will enable DisplayPort operation simultaneously with "
"analog OSD. If a UART is set to DisplayPort by default, so should the OSD "
"type."
msgstr ""
"注明是否提供板载 OSD。hwdef 应已设置 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>`。在 defaults.param 文件中添加 "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` 5 可同时启用 DisplayPort 和模拟 OSD 操作。若某 UART 默认设置为 "
"DisplayPort，OSD 类型也应相应设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/readme_file.rst:121 c319f06a28944c1ab991ceaeefc9db66
